@startuml

scale max 1200 width
scale max 900 height

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor<<PostgreSQL>> #336791
  FontColor White
}

component "REST API\n(OrdersController)" as API

component "Idempotency &\nCommand Processor" as CommandHandler #lightblue

component "PostgreSQL Channel\nSubscription Processor\n(LISTEN/NOTIFY)" as SubscriptionProcessor #lightblue

component "Batch Processor\n(Retry & DLQ)" as BatchProcessor #lightblue

component "Synchronous\nProjection Updater" as SyncEventHandler #lightblue

component "Asynchronous\nEvent Handler" as AsyncEventHandler #lightblue

component "Projection\nRepository" as Repository #lightgreen

database "PostgreSQL\n(Event Store, Outbox,\nProjections & DLQ)" as Postgres <<PostgreSQL>>

queue Kafka #White

queue "Dead Letter Queue\n(ES_EVENT_SUBSCRIPTION_DEAD_LETTER)" as DLQ #lightpink

API -> CommandHandler: **1.** Execute command\l(Idempotency check)
CommandHandler --> Postgres: **2.** Check/acquire lease,\lread aggregate & append event
CommandHandler -> SyncEventHandler: **3.** Handle\lnew events
SyncEventHandler --> Postgres: **4.** Update\lread model (RM_ORDER)
API .> Repository: **5.** Execute\lquery
Repository ...> Postgres: **6.** Query\lprojections
Postgres -.-> SubscriptionProcessor: **7.** pg_notify\l('es_event')
SubscriptionProcessor -up-> Postgres: **8.** Batch fetch\lnew events
SubscriptionProcessor -> BatchProcessor: **9.** Dispatch\levent batch
BatchProcessor -> AsyncEventHandler: **10.** Invoke\lhandler
AsyncEventHandler --> Postgres: **11.** Read aggregate
AsyncEventHandler -right-> Kafka: **12.** Send\lintegration event
BatchProcessor -.-> DLQ: **13.** Isolate poison pills\lafter max retries
BatchProcessor --> Postgres: **14.** Advance\lcheckpoint

@enduml
